## Google Maps API key (Android)

Copy this file to `local.properties` (same folder) and add your key:

```properties
sdk.dir=C\:\\Users\\YOUR_USER\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\sdk
MAPS_API_KEY=YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY
```

Get a key from [Google Cloud Console](https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis):
- Enable **Maps SDK for Android**
- Enable **Maps SDK for iOS** (if building for iOS)
- Enable **Maps JavaScript API** (for web)

Restrict each key to your app's package name / bundle ID in production.
